.claude/session-diary.md

# AI harness — keep the folder skeleton and the prompt templates only;
# internal process artifacts (plans, reviews, handoffs, investigations) stay local
ai/**
!ai/*/
!ai/**/.gitkeep
!ai/prompts/**
ai/prompts/generated-*.md
/ANALISI_TECNICA_MORALSTACK.md
/claude_upgrade_plan.md
/codex_upgrade_plan.md

